  m_text: "WARNING: VEHICLE FACTORY RESET\n\r\nYou are about to enter the vehicle
    factory reset sequence.\n\r\nThis procedure is used when transferring ownership,
    reselling the vehicle, or clearing all custom configurations.\r\n\u2022 All stored
    owner passwords and guest passes will be removed.\r\n\u2022 All digital keys
    and paired mobile apps will lose access to the vehicle.\r\n\u2022 Statutory compliance
    and forensic blackbox logs will be safely retained.\n\r\nPress \"Continue\" to
    begin the reset procedure, or \"Cancel\" to return."
